佛法藝文化」的理念，於2004年1月正式設立，面積逾7000平方尺，規劃成美術展覽廳及佛教文物廳兩部份，抱持著一份為社會服務、美化人心的信念，為民眾提供一個心靈開放的空間，一個參與、互動的文化藝術天地，體現出「佛法與藝術的真善美」意境。"}],["w366072472",3.03634,101.44584,"park","Taman Bandar Diraja Klang",4,{"ts":"2026-11","cd":"2026-11-13"}],["w397745765",3.02586,101.44354,"temple","Klang Coast Buddhist Association",26,{"ts":"2026-08","cd":"2026-08-14","rel":"buddhist"}],["w691856200",3.10163,101.59134,"park","Sterling Park",27,{"oh":"Mo-Fr 09:00-17:00","ad":"Jalan SS 7/19 No. No.3","ts":"2019-05"}],["w696534753",3.03213,101.4264,"temple","Nichiren Shoshu Malaysia Propagation Centre",28,{"ad":"Jalan Hilir","ts":"2023-05","rel":"buddhist"}],["w712620261",3.04195,101.44717,"worship","Masjid India Muslim Tengku Kelana",4,{"w":"https://selangor.travel/listing/masjid-india-muslim-tengku-kelana-klang/","ts":"2026-11","cd":"2026-11-15","wp":"ms:Masjid_India_Muslim_Tengku_Kelana","rel":"muslim","x":1}],["w852296955",3.0774,101.4769,"temple","Bodhi Park Shah Alam",13,{"w":"https://bodhipark.wordpress.com/about/","ad":"Persiaran Serai Wangi No. 1A","ts":"2023-02","rel":"buddhist"}],["w1127809374",3.07782,101.588,"bar","The Enclave",16,{"ad":"Jalan SS 15/4E No. 59","ts":"2025-07"}],["r18164892",3.10935,101.50563,"nationalpark","Hutan Simpanan Kekal Bukit Cherakah Tambahan",11,{"ts":"2024-10"}],["r18167644",2.84065,101.42393,"nationalpark","Hutan Simpanan Kekal Bukit Jugra",22,{"ts":"2024-10"}],["r18167642",2.84457,101.4223,"nationalpark","Hutan Simpanan Kekal Bukit Jugra Tambahan",22,{"ts":"2024-10"}],["w1353573658",2.81722,101.44863,"worship","Masjid Sultan Abdul Samad",29,{"ad":"Jalan Simpang Jugra","ts":"2025-01","rel":"muslim"}],["w1381608070",3.1578,101.47022,"worship","Masjid Al-Falah",30,{"ts":"2025-10","wd":"Q20457137","wp":"ms:Masjid Al-Falah, Kampung Budiman","rel":"muslim","x":1}],["n4268037689",3.03773,101.44271,"temple","觀音亭",19,{"ts":"2026-11","cd":"2026-11-19","rel":"buddhist"}],["n4728732961",2.93263,101.49255,"worship","Masjid Al-Amin",31,{"ad":"Jalan Kebun Baru Batu 9","ts"